---
---

<section id="trust" class="bg-paper py-[130px] scroll-mt-[90px] border-b border-line-dark max-[760px]:py-[75px]">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Trust, layered</div>
    <h2>Confidence, built into the working relationship.</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 border border-line-dark mt-[60px] max-[760px]:grid-cols-2 max-[760px]:mt-[35px] max-[420px]:grid-cols-1">
      <div class="p-[27px] border-r border-line-dark max-[760px]:border-b max-[420px]:border-r-0">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] mb-[22px] text-[#72776b]">VETTING · 01</div>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[30px] mb-[15px]">Screened</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">CV, credentials and ACCA/ACA status verified at source.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-[27px] border-r border-line-dark max-[760px]:border-b max-[760px]:border-r-0">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] mb-[22px] text-[#72776b]">VETTING · 02</div>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[30px] mb-[15px]">Tested</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Practical assessment matched to the accounting role and work required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-[27px] border-r border-line-dark max-[760px]:border-b max-[420px]:border-r-0">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] mb-[22px] text-[#72776b]">VETTING · 03</div>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[30px] mb-[15px]">Referenced</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Two professional references, spoken to, not just listed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-[27px] bg-[#e8e9df] max-[760px]:border-b">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] mb-[22px] text-[#72776b]">VETTING · 04</div>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[30px] mb-[15px]">Introduced</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Only then does a CV reach your inbox. Scope agreed together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[35px_45px] mt-[65px] max-[1050px]:gap-[30px] max-[760px]:grid-cols-2 max-[420px]:grid-cols-1">
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.1</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">NDA before anything</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Signed before any client information is shared. Per-engagement confidentiality undertakings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.2</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">Your systems only</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Work happens inside your software under permissions you grant and revoke.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.3</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">Clear data handling</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Agree data processing terms, access permissions and confidentiality requirements before work starts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.4</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">Defined responsibilities</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Set out scope, review ownership and engagement requirements before onboarding.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.5</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">Your review process</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Clear working papers, agreed review points and feedback incorporated into the delivery process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative border-t border-line-dark pt-[25px]">
        <span class="absolute top-[28px] right-0 text-[10px] opacity-50">C.6</span>
        <span class="tick">✓</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif font-normal text-[29px] my-[15px]">Working hours aligned to your needs</h4>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-mut-dark">Discuss your expectations and agree review points before the engagement starts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-[65px] border-t border-line-dark pt-[30px]">
      <h4 class="font-sans font-semibold text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-[23px]">What we will never do</h4>
      <ul class="list-none grid grid-cols-2 gap-[15px_35px] text-[14px] max-[760px]:grid-cols-1">
        <li class="before:content-['—'] before:mr-[14px]">Approach your clients outside the agreed engagement.</li>
        <li class="before:content-['—'] before:mr-[14px]">Use your data outside the agreed scope.</li>
        <li class="before:content-['—'] before:mr-[14px]">Send a CV we haven't tested and referenced.</li>
        <li class="before:content-['—'] before:mr-[14px]">Change the agreed scope without discussing it with you.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
